      },
      "rationale": "Validates assessment evidence against the evidence-bytes edges the publisher recorded in the assessment's own examined-inputs declaration. It requires those paths to sit inside the assessment's confined evidence directory and reads each through _read_bound_byte against its recorded digest, rather than rebuilding a destination from how an evidenceRef is spelled.",
      "role": "enforcement"
